  <item>
    <title>省钱 2.0，从学会修马桶开始</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660ae58c1519139e4f019513</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660ae58c1519139e4f019513</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCftlYign0Bx7HBPwiYxtlD-Jku.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《GQ实验室》发表观点：打工人省钱2.0，从学会家庭维修开始；每一只不会修的马桶，都在暗中标好了价格。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们进入了最危险的话题领域：我们都是怎么花钱的？捅过哪些花钱窟窿？别人花过哪些让我们大惊失色（但被迫保持扑克脸）的钱？被借钱了，哪些状况该借，哪些不该？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将在本期节目中听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 哪一次花钱经历，让我们感慨自己的钱也太好赚了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> 赛赛的“黑白绷带疑云“，她开始怀疑自己会晚节不保</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 兔子的日常出行新体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 赛赛感叹：翡翠，好神奇啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3533">58:53</a> 赛赛的厨房装备，Vol.1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">1:07:35</a> 金子提问：是不是人爱上运动后，都会爱穿荧光色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4223">1:10:23</a> 被借钱故事两则：一个略惨，一个会笑死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5128">1:25:28</a> 我们的胆小，阻碍了我们赚大钱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5417">1:30:17</a> 尽力少花冤枉钱，两个思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5890">1:38:10</a> 一些小小快乐花钱推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，@听完本期的GQ茶友，你最近有花什么冤枉钱？如果你愿意说的话。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSgPRN3p3eZUjqsYFGrEzhVyMju.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt9cSprKgazFGoj0SJYaQTNMhHmo.m4a" length="209145305" type="audio/mp4"/>
