  <item>
    <title>窝囊男茶话会：不逞强，也是一种男人医美</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fa716467649570796884e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fa716467649570796884e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Mar 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4y4gQ_3gDjjHq99gFgTUu2vUKv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《GQ实验室》发表观点：荧幕窝囊男，爱看，多拍点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中，顺着同事 Claire 采访白客这个话头，四位主播聊了聊（近期）（但又有点过气）热门男角类型，窝囊男。</span></p><span></span><p><span>四个人对窝囊男的理解太不一样了！四个人分为四派：唯爱窝囊宝宝型，“窝囊男，一起玩”型，“看窝囊男找乐子“型，“窝囊自有真情在”型。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一期不太有主线的茶话会，但我们还是聊到了以下几件有意思的事情：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 分歧一开场就出现了：有人想聊窝囊男，有人（只）想聊窝囊帅哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">7:50</a> 同事里藏了一个白客前同事，10年前的白客啥样子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 赛赛版本的7种荧幕窝囊男类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 《武林外传》，早期窝囊男宝典（可爱版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 荧幕窝囊男具备了哪种特质，会立马变得不讨喜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> “窝囊男”，多大程度上是东亚专属？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 我们还想看哪些男演员演一演窝囊男？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 荧幕窝囊男影视游推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，@听完本期的GQ茶友，我们还漏了哪些荧幕窝囊男？评论区帮我们补充一下。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuASbhqN8sRTANQLp-q919-t2kGN.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpIw__pwCqVCmRbKxcQQa1_n7YAW.m4a" length="102508290" type="audio/mp4"/>
