  <item>
    <title>“80后妈”大辩论：是异性恋太无聊，还是社畜需要精神薯片？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f411da676495707985a908</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f411da676495707985a908</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 09:16:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmB_7G3OmSI1b1vsRk8sQ50-NYlH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《GQ实验室》赶个晚集：上周末 Simon 和赛赛进食了最近讨论度最高的内容产品，短剧《我在八零年代当后妈》，观后感差别蛮大。</span></p><span></span><p><span>简单粗暴总结，赛赛：蛮好的，我懂了；Simon：看不进去，异性恋好无聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是有了这一集的讨论，二位输出了以下个人见解：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">2:24</a> “80后妈”的服化道，是不是有向韩剧学习？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 短剧里是不是不需要角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">5:01</a> “伪怀旧”，有效的城市社畜舒压策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">7:06</a> 女频短剧掌握的两种性唤起策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 有没有一种可能，表面狗血的短剧击中了两层社畜情绪事实？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> “你是不是瞧不起我“，咱老东亚的情绪命门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> Simon 吐槽短剧里的异性恋模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 短剧的脸谱化恶人，不适应的也许是少数？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 赛赛暴论：先婚后爱，一种更有效的性解放思路</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sidenote：本期开场时我们说，这会是一期短节目，结果最后也没短到哪里去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来《茶水间7分半》还会接着改版，争取越改越短。敬请期待。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtW-OXARgxg_FZqT-YrVQrB7Yzv8.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltS3uJ1UkJCeXS0YxH9yBGBeRYMM.m4a" length="73822646" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqczB1SC1mWGdFY0hLMXhVTENodkxsTGZqZGsucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
